[622.97114, "o", "--- k4 (precomputed xl, includes split kernel) ---\r\nk4 BM=256 BN=128 BK=32 GM=8 w=8 s=4: 3.24436977174547 ms\r\nk4 BM=256 BN=128 BK=32 GM=8 w=8 s=5: FAIL out of resource: shared memory, Required: 245760, Hardware limit: 232448. Reduci ms\r\nk4 BM=256 BN=128 BK=32 GM=8 w=8 s=6: FAIL out of resource: shared memory, Required: 294912, Hardware limit: 232448. Reduci ms\r\nk4 BM=256 BN=128 BK=64 GM=8 w=8 s=3: FAIL out of resource: shared memory, Required: 294912, Hardware limit: 232448. Reduci ms\r\nk4 BM=256 BN=128 BK=64 GM=8 w=8 s=4: FAIL out of resource: shared memory, Required: 393216, Hardware limit: 232448. Reduci ms\r\nk4 BM=256 BN=256 BK=32 GM=8 w=8 s=3: 32.02543958028158 ms\r\nk4 BM=256 BN=64 BK=32 GM=8 w=4 s=4: 4.1830471356709795 ms\r\nk4 BM=128 BN=128 BK=32 GM=8 w=8 s=4: 3.632522609498766 ms\r\nk4 BM=256 BN=128 BK=32 GM=4 w=8 s=4: 3.2591289149390326 ms\r\nk4 BM=256 BN=128 BK=32 GM=16 w=8 s=4: 3.267025762134128 ms\r\n--- tf32 direct (reference point) ---\r\ntf BM=128 BN=128 BK=32 GM=8 w=8 s=4: 6.635580433739556 ms\r\ntf BM=128 B"]
[622.971203, "o", "N=128 BK=64 GM=8 w=8 s=3: 6.535676426357693 ms\r\ntf BM=256 BN=128 BK=32 GM=8 w=8 s=4: 3.837041801876492 ms\r\ntf BM=128 BN=256 BK=64 GM=8 w=8 s=3: FAIL out of resource: shared memory, Required: 294912, Hardware limit: 232448. Reduci ms\r\nk4 err: 0.00010013580322265625\r\n"]
